  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "Family dinner. At the table, a father and his sons.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "Eat your soup properly! Why are you picking at it like that, it's disgusting to watch!",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "What are you yelling for?",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "I'm yelling? Why, you little punk!",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.2,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "And smack, on the back of the head!",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "character": "paren",
      "text": "Dad, if a person doesn't want to eat, why are you forcing him, and hitting him too? You're just like a tyrant.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "I'm a tyrant? Why, you little rat!",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.2,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "And smack, smack, on the ears. Then the youngest puts down his spoon and covers his ears with his hands.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.4,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l9",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "And why are you covering up? You eat well, you're polite, you don't talk back to your father, what are you afraid of?",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "character": "vovochka",
      "text": "I know I'm polite. It's just in case, you're such a jerk...",
      "uncensored": "I know I'm polite. It's just in case, you're such an asshole...",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": [],
      "laugh": "big"
    }
  ],
